{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1549.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"16ce62250490b3fc7f0d5d60c7aeaa8a7b656215db6732c1bf94174fe9ab8b6b","ja":"大量に買ったものは？","zh":"大量购买的东西是？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1549.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"d62694ad3eaf569d10d5a0afd672957364720efda001d8890d52afc0cbac6aa0","ja":"（ウフフッ、大量大量♪\nこれでしばらくは楽しめるわね♪）","zh":"（呵呵呵，大丰收大丰收♪\n这下能让我享受一阵子了呢♪）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1549.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"ec62b07a64acfd8e709a49200621f45e199630c554a23ce899f5f97ed91883ab","ja":"見つけた！　あのっ、このみさん！！","zh":"找到了！那个，木实小姐！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1549.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"8268b0f6b82caa4f45c2420e8f597a1cefbcf706b3d96f182e19e88d5ceae185","ja":"えっ、育ちゃん！？　春香ちゃんも！？\nなんでここに！？","zh":"诶，小育！？春香也在！？\n怎么会在这里！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1549.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"6543fa73d6023ea39cef3c454c0c779f2ea8fe2a0406651ce2d4dec4bcf57eb7","ja":"すみません……最近、このみさんが爆買いしてるのは\nストレスが原因なんじゃって、心配になって……。","zh":"对不起……我最近有点担心，\n木实姐疯狂购物是不是因为压力太大了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1549.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"bc9b198d10bb18f179705543a577e4fd07c500c89bd01c4d2db3e0c1e5dd9b13","ja":"2日前にわたしが見た時もそうだったし、\n昨日もお買い物してたんだよね？","zh":"2天前我看到的时候也是那样，\n而且昨天也在买东西对吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1549.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"f4eda01a878506b8adb8ccbaf3e25243d40963c8598f6eeb9067d977b6d4282a","ja":"えっ！　そ、そう、育ちゃんにも見られてたの……。\nふたりには、心配かけちゃったわね。","zh":"诶！这、这样啊，也被小育看到了呀……\n让你们两个人担心了呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1549.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"ebfe3ff38f72026580be7531131134c8d03c5fe0dbfc039743b02fb1f08a76fe","ja":"えーっと……実はね、これ全部、\n感謝祭セールで安くなってたDVDなのよ。","zh":"那个……其实呢，这些全都是\n在感谢祭特卖时便宜买到的DVD哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1549.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"242f37eb280d4505c12ad86863ba55674268db89aa8f665eb35beb5e87aacd7f","ja":"昔に大ヒットした北米ドラマとか洋画のDVDが、\nBOXを含めてお手頃価格になってたから、つい……。","zh":"以前很火的美剧和外国电影的DVD，\n连套装盒装版都变得很实惠，结果忍不住就……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1549.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"3b0f7226189b21c4ae6f8a7f1942dae76cbbaa15fd714c1231deecb67086e113","ja":"なるほど、それでそんなに……。","zh":"原来如此，所以才会那么……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1549.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"924a70bfead33175b343f1fc212be8ab13530ee3f8b24b76cdafe73124870c03","ja":"あれ？　でも、この間の荷物も今のも\nすごく重そうですけど、DVDでそんなになります？","zh":"奇怪？不过，之前那个包裹和现在的\n看起来都非常沉呢，装DVD会变得这么重吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1549.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"a076a073138b5658db033efe30627b9ae2d41c99e124687d49a29a98fd3cf728","ja":"あ……それは、その……お酒のコーナーも、\n感謝祭セールの対象だったから……つい……。","zh":"啊……那个，这个嘛……酒水专区也\n赶上了感谢祭大减价……所以就忍不住……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1549.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"1e62348d875775b71adf98b95e866d46c5c7dd2db062990fbd7645492fff0b10","ja":"ええっ！　その袋、お酒がいっぱい入ってるの？\nそれって、大丈夫なの？","zh":"诶？！那个袋子里，装了好多酒吗？\n那样真的没问题吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1549.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"a3e0bfb3c26380bea2fa746d412cf670396dcf505d6552f7abfbc482e4c968ed","ja":"うーん……どうしよう？\n●●●●プロデューサーさんに相談してみよっか……？","zh":"唔……该怎么办呢？\n要不要去找●●●●制作人商量一下呢……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1549.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"2ec64001c44edb0a38f23a3ae96aad339551cf6df38c08a6151a64ee6f62873d","ja":"うっ……！　そんな反応されると思ってたから\n隠したかったのに……！","zh":"呜……！就是因为料到会有这种反应\n才想藏起来的啊……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1549.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"5f58c903028f9ce293d7e2c8f2eab51eeb485acbd4ea2a0dad59da6e6a4677cb","ja":"お願い！　お酒を爆買いしたことはナイショにしてて！\nセール中のお店で、なんでも買ってあげるから～！","zh":"拜托了！我爆买酒的事情一定要保密哦！\n打折的店里不管什么我都给你买啦～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
